              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Futhi kumelwe abhece elinye igazi ezimpondweni ze-altare eliphambi kukaJehova etendeni lokuhlangana, lonke igazi alithulule esinqeni se-altare lomnikelo wokushiswa elisemnyango wethempeli. Ithente lokuhlangana.",
          "type": "text",
